"Draft a spec for a topic."
,
"cn"
:
"为某个主题起草规格说明。"
}
]
,
"#tip:note"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"`x ai` keeps no configuration of its own. Subcommands call `x ask --quick` (the same one-shot helper used by `x git commit`); the low-level `x ai request` passes through to `x agent request`. Pick a harness and credentials with `x agent init` / `x agent setup` / `x agent --cfg zero_harness=claude` (or kimi-cli / codex / gemini-cli / opencode)."
,
"cn"
:
"`x ai` 不维护自己的配置。子命令调用 `x ask --quick`（与 `x git commit` 共用的纯净问答入口）；`x ai request` 透传到 `x agent request`。请通过 `x agent init` / `x agent setup` / `x agent --cfg zero_harness=claude`（或 kimi-cli / codex / gemini-cli / opencode）选择 harness 与凭据。"
}
]
,
"#other"
:
{
"en"
:
{
"Local mirror of x-cmd-action/ai:"
:
"https://github.com/x-cmd-action/ai"
}
,
"cn"
:
{
"本地版，对应 GitHub Action："
:
"https://github.com/x-cmd-action/ai"
}
}
}

